"A great way to get out and get some fresh air is on a bicycle. That’s what bike paths are for and the one in Ershuei is a perfect example. It offers a smooth riding surface in an environment free of cars, scooters and pollution. It is definitely one of the better paths in Taiwan.": "2f042db57274",
