"Cara is very thirsty, so she got a 2 liter bottle of Sprite out of the fridge. Now she is taking the lid off the bottle. The lid is screwed on tight. Cara twists as hard as she can before it finally moves. When she breaks the seal, the soda makes a loud “psht” sound.": "80160f6b716b",
